# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — Debug namespace from urbiscript.
#
# Spec §10.2 / §14 exit-criterion 9: Debug.coros() from urbiscript
# returns the same coros JSON shape as the NDJSON introspect op.  The
# native urbi_introspect_coros() backs both; Debug.coros() converts the
# JSON to a String which the dispatcher then wraps as a JSON-string
# value (escapes the inner quotes).  We search for the substring
# "coros\\" — the escaped form of the inner JSON key after the
# dispatcher's eval-result JSON-string wrapper has been applied.

> {"id":15,"op":"eval","code":"Debug.coros()"}
< "id":15 | "kind":"result" | coros
< "id":15 | "kind":"done"
